        "original_paragraph": "Compound UA-18 or UA-30 was fixed on the chip by photo-crosslinking, then recombinant SARS-CoV-2 S-trimer protein (DRA 47, Novoprotein Inc. Shanghai) at indicated concentrations was injected sequentially into the chamber in buffer PBST (0.1% Tween 20, pH 7.4). The interaction of S-trimer with UA-18 or UA-30 fixed was detected by PlexArrayTM HT SPRi (Seattle, US). The reaction temperature was controlled at 4 \u25e6C, binding time was 600 s, disassociation time was 360 s, flow rate was 0.5 \u03bcL/s. The chip was regenerated with Glycine Hydrochloride (pH 2.0). The data of interaction signals was retrieved and analyzed with PlexeraDE software.",
